    "backstory": "Born in the shadow of the old Bill Yards brewery, Bubbles learned to survive by scavenging scraps and outsmarting rival flocks. The toxic environment warped his beak into a weapon, and he honed his skills in the back alleys, becoming a legend whispered among the downtrodden.",
